{%- set s = settings -%}
<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>Ordering</h2>
    <p>{{ s.name }} is a licensed and insured home bakery in {{ s.city }}, {{ s.region }}. All orders are custom orders; there is no walk-in storefront.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Custom orders:</strong> request through the <a href="/order/">custom order form</a>, by text or call at {{ s.phone }}, or by email at {{ s.email }}. How far ahead to order: {{ s.leadTime | ph | safe }}</li>
      <li><strong>Quick Order cakes:</strong> need {{ quickOrder.noticeDays }} full days' notice. Order by {{ computed.cutoffLabel }}, {{ quickOrder.noticeDays }} days before your pickup day. Designs are made exactly as shown; colors can be changed.</li>
      <li>Laura replies within {{ s.replyTime | ph | safe }}</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Payment</h2>
    <p>Accepted: {{ s.payments | join(", ") }}.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Custom orders:</strong> {{ s.paymentTerms | ph | safe }}</li>
      <li><strong>Quick Order cakes:</strong> {% for r in quickOrder.rules %}{% if loop.first %}{{ r }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Pickup</h2>
    <p>Pickup is in {{ s.city }}. <mark class="ph">[[PLACEHOLDER: how the pickup address is shared with customers]]</mark> Quick Order pickup windows are {{ s.pickupWindows | join(" or ") }}, confirmed by text or email.</p>

    <h2>Delivery</h2>
    <p>Delivery is available. {{ s.deliveryNote | ph | safe }}</p>

    <h2>Changes and cancellations</h2>
    <p><mark class="ph">[[PLACEHOLDER: change and cancellation policy]]</mark></p>

    <h2>Allergies</h2>
    <p><mark class="ph">[[PLACEHOLDER: allergy, nut and gluten-free policy]]</mark></p>
  </div>
</section>

